Articles go here as .md files, one per piece.

Frontmatter contract is defined and commented in src/content.config.ts.
Required: kind (blog|thought-leadership|playbook), title, dek, published.

The filename becomes the slug:
  why-nobody-posts-a-salary.md
    with kind: thought-leadership
    ->  /insights/thought-leadership/why-nobody-posts-a-salary

Set dataAsOf on any piece quoting a figure from our own database, so the
page states the date those numbers were measured.
